/academie-art/main/maj/lanceur-2-0.part"},{"h":"658482f7541bbce16d3aff0ff104beba22cfa4baa0a62b2a77b34cbd1bf8cb62","s":94371840,"u":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PataphiX-creator/academie-art/main/maj/lanceur-2-1.part"},{"h":"ca51c9025e224add66f16d78cb6eb9af85cddbb2eb599fa3bcc4db6a213a59c2","s":94371840,"u":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PataphiX-creator/academie-art/main/maj/lanceur-2-2.part"},{"h":"66ef4926367fbe0c22d8fca26ab43e13d12b5ac86bd18424d928f37d2cd6effe","s":77610496,"u":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PataphiX-creator/academie-art/main/maj/lanceur-2-3.part"}],"s":360726016},"minLauncher":1,"notes":{"en":"Smoother on low-end PCs and while streaming: Medium, Low and Very low (new) quality now use a lighter renderer (no anti-aliasing or bloom, simple shadows, 3 lights). While OBS captures the game, “Auto” frame rate switches to 30 FPS.","es":"Más fluido en PC modestos y en directo: las calidades Media, Baja y Muy baja (nueva) usan un renderizado ligero (sin antialiasing ni resplandor, sombras simples, 3 luces). Mientras OBS captura el juego, la fluidez «Auto» pasa a 30 FPS.","fr":"Jeu plus fluide sur les PC modestes et en stream : en qualité Moyenne, Basse et Très basse (nouveau niveau), rendu allégé (sans anticrénelage ni halo, ombres simplifiées, 3 lumières). Pendant une capture OBS, la fluidité « Auto » passe à 30 images/s.","ja":"低スペックPCや配信中でも快適に:画質「中」「低」「最低」(新規)は軽量レンダリング(アンチエイリアス・ブルームなし、簡易影、ライト3つ)。OBSでキャプチャ中は、フレームレート「自動」が30FPSになります。","zh":"在低配电脑和直播时更流畅:画质「中」「低」「极低」(新增)使用轻量渲染(无抗锯齿和泛光、简化阴影、3个光源)。OBS 捕获游戏时,「自动」帧率改为 30 FPS。"},"version":"2.2.4"}